(2044, 'Monterra Adjustable Chaise', 'owlee-monterra-adjustable-chaise-428-ch', '428-CH', NULL, 'The O.W. Lee Monterra Adjustable Chaise combines timeless Mediterranean influence with customizable comfort. Featuring a robust wrought iron frame and adjustable reclining positions, this outdoor chaise lounge offers a relaxing retreat with classic, rustic style. O.W. Lee is renowned for its exceptional quality, supported by an industry-leading warranty. Our frames are covered by a 20-year structural warranty, and the finish is guaranteed against fading, blistering, and peeling for 5 years. Cushions and fabrics are also backed by a 5-year warranty. With a selection of 10 elegant frame finishes and over 100 fabric options, including 16 sling fabrics, customers can easily customize each piece to seamlessly complement their individual style.', 13, 43, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'H 45.5" × W 42.5" × D 87"', FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, 21, TRUE, '2026-05-03T01:40:46.811Z'::timestamptz, '2026-06-23T18:22:37.259Z'::timestamptz, 0, '{"height_in":"45.5","collection":"Monterra","weight_lbs":"120 (pkg)","arm_height_in":"25.5","seat_height_in":"19","spec_sheet_pdf":"https://www.owlee.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/2026-Monterra_Retail_SpecSheet_428-CH-Adjustable-Chaise.pdf","depth_length_in":"87","width_diameter_in":"42.5"}'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, 'fixed', NULL, '["o-w-lee","monterra","made-in-usa"]'::jsonb, TRUE, NULL, NULL, 'Monterra', 'monterra', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Chaise', NULL, NULL),
(2045, 'Classico Lounge Chair', 'owlee-classico-lounge-chair-956-ccw', '956-CCW', NULL, 'If you’re looking for a classic outdoor lounge chair that feels just as good as it looks, the O.W. Lee Classico Lounge Chair delivers. It brings the collection’s signature traditional style into a relaxed, lounge-ready design, complete with decorative metalwork and plush cushions that invite you to sit back and stay awhile. It’s the kind of chair that instantly makes an outdoor space feel warm, comfortable, and refined. Like everything O.W. Lee makes, the Classico Lounge Chair is built to last. The wrought iron frame is backed by a 20-year structural warranty, while the finish is guaranteed for 5 years against fading, blistering, and peeling. Cushions and fabrics are also covered for 5 years, so you can enjoy both comfort and peace of mind season after season. Customization is where this chair really shines. Choose from 10 elegant frame finishes and over 100 fabric options to create a look that fits your space and your style perfectly. Whether you’re furnishing a cozy patio or a full outdoor living area, the Classico Lounge Chair offers timeless design, exceptional comfort, and craftsmanship you can trust.', 13, 43, NULL, NULL, '46.00', 'H 38.5" × W 28" × D 36.75"', FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, 22, TRUE, '2026-05-03T01:40:46.818Z'::timestamptz, '2026-06-23T18:22:37.259Z'::timestamptz, 0, '{"height_in":"38.5","collection":"Classico","weight_lbs":"46","arm_height_in":"26.5","seat_height_in":"18","spec_sheet_pdf":"https://www.owlee.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/Classico_Retail_SpecSheets_2026-upd_Part9.pdf","depth_length_in":"36.75","width_diameter_in":"28"}'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, 'fixed', NULL, '["o-w-lee","classico","made-in-usa"]'::jsonb, TRUE, NULL, NULL, 'Classico', 'classico', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Lounge Chairs', NULL, NULL),
(2046, 'Classico Swivel Rocker Lounge Chair', 'owlee-classico-swivel-rocker-lounge-chair-956-srw', '956-SRW', NULL, 'The O.W. Lee Classico Swivel Rocker Lounge Chair blends graceful design with gentle movement. Featuring smooth swivel and rocking motion, this outdoor lounge chair offers relaxed comfort wrapped in traditional sophistication. O.W. Lee is renowned for its exceptional quality, supported by an industry-leading warranty. Our frames are covered by a 20-year structural warranty, and the finish is guaranteed against fading, blistering, and peeling for 5 years. Cushions and fabrics are also backed by a 5-year warranty. With a selection of 10 elegant frame finishes and over 100 fabric options, customers can easily customize each piece to seamlessly complement their individual style.', 13, 43, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'H 40.75" × W 28" × D 34.25"', FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, 23, TRUE, '2026-05-03T01:40:46.822Z'::timestamptz, '2026-06-23T18:22:37.259Z'::timestamptz, 0, '{"height_in":"40.75","collection":"Classico","weight_lbs":"57 (pkg)","arm_height_in":"26.75","seat_height_in":"17.75","spec_sheet_pdf":"https://www.owlee.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/Classico_Retail_SpecSheets_2026-upd_Part11.pdf","depth_length_in":"34.25","width_diameter_in":"28"}'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, 'fixed', NULL, '["o-w-lee","classico","made-in-usa"]'::jsonb, TRUE, NULL, NULL, 'Classico', 'classico', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Lounge Chairs', NULL, NULL),
(2047, 'Classico Spring Base Lounge Chair', 'owlee-classico-spring-base-lounge-chair-956-sbt', '956-SBT', NULL, 'If you love the look of classic outdoor furniture but want a little extra comfort, the O.W. Lee Classico Spring Base Lounge Chair is a perfect fit. It takes the timeless elegance of the Classico collection and adds gentle motion, thanks to a spring-supported base that responds as you sit and relax. The result is a lounge chair that feels supportive, comfortable, and effortlessly inviting. Ornate metal details highlight the collection’s European-inspired craftsmanship, giving the chair a refined, old-world appeal. As with all O.W. Lee furniture, this chair is built for long-term outdoor living. The wrought iron frame is protected by a 20-year structural warranty, and the finish is backed for 5 years against fading, blistering, and peeling. Cushions and fabrics also carry a 5-year warranty, so you can enjoy comfort and durability with confidence. Personalizing your chair is easy. Choose from 10 elegant frame finishes and over 100 fabric options to create a look that feels uniquely yours. Whether you’re designing a quiet retreat or a sophisticated outdoor lounge, the Classico Spring Base Lounge Chair delivers classic style, subtle motion, and lasting comfort.', 13, 43, NULL, NULL, '58.00', 'H 41" × W 28" × D 33.25"', FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, 24, TRUE, '2026-05-03T01:40:46.826Z'::timestamptz, '2026-06-23T18:22:37.259Z'::timestamptz, 0, '{"height_in":"41","collection":"Classico","weight_lbs":"58","arm_height_in":"26.5","seat_height_in":"17.5","spec_sheet_pdf":"https://www.owlee.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/Classico_Retail_SpecSheets_2026-upd_Part10.pdf","depth_length_in":"33.25","width_diameter_in":"28"}'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, 'fixed', NULL, '["o-w-lee","classico","made-in-usa"]'::jsonb, TRUE, NULL, NULL, 'Classico', 'classico', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Lounge Chairs', NULL, NULL),
(2048, 'Classico High-Back Spring Base Lounge Chair', 'owlee-classico-high-back-spring-base-lounge-chair-937-sbw', '937-SBW', NULL, 'If you want maximum comfort with a more commanding, classic look, the O.W. Lee Classico High Back Spring Base Lounge Chair delivers on all fronts. Its taller back provides extra support for relaxed lounging, while the spring base adds gentle motion that responds naturally as you sit. Together, they create a chair that feels as good as it looks--supportive, comfortable, and inviting. True to the Classico collection, this chair features a stately, Old World silhouette with refined detailing that brings a sense of timeless European elegance to any outdoor space. It’s an ideal choice for those who appreciate traditional design but don’t want to compromise on comfort. Built with O.W. Lee’s legendary craftsmanship, the frame is backed by a 20-year structural warranty, and the finish is guaranteed for 5 years against fading, blistering, and peeling. Cushions and fabrics are also covered for 5 years, ensuring long-lasting performance outdoors. To make it your own, choose from 10 elegant frame finishes and over 100 fabric options. Whether it’s part of a full seating arrangement or a standout lounge piece, the Classico High Back Spring Base Lounge Chair offers elevated comfort, subtle motion, and enduring style.', 13, 43, NULL, NULL, '60.00', 'H 43.75" × W 28" × D 34.75"', FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, 25, TRUE, '2026-05-03T01:40:46.830Z'::timestamptz, '2026-06-23T18:22:37.259Z'::timestamptz, 0, '{"height_in":"43.75","collection":"Classico","weight_lbs":"60","arm_height_in":"26.5","seat_height_in":"17.5","spec_sheet_pdf":"https://www.owlee.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/Classico_Retail_SpecSheets_2026_937-SBW-Hi-Back-Spring-Base-Lounge-Chair.pdf","depth_length_in":"34.75","width_diameter_in":"28"}'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, 'fixed', NULL, '["o-w-lee","classico","made-in-usa"]'::jsonb, TRUE, NULL, NULL, 'Classico', 'classico', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Lounge Chairs', NULL, NULL),
(2049, 'Classico High-Back Swivel Rocker Lounge Chair', 'owlee-classico-high-back-swivel-rocker-lounge-chair-937-srw', '937-SRW', NULL, 'If comfort is your top priority but you still want timeless style, the O.W. Lee Classico High Back Swivel Rocker Lounge Chair checks every box. The tall, supportive back is perfect for leaning in and relaxing, while the smooth swivel and gentle rocking motion let you move naturally and stay comfortable for longer stretches outdoors. It’s an ideal chair for conversations, quiet moments, and everything in between. Design-wise, this chair stays true to the Classico collection’s classic European influence. Refined detailing and an elegant silhouette give it a polished, Old World look that elevates any patio or outdoor living space. As with all O.W. Lee furniture, quality and durability come standard. The wrought iron frame is backed by a 20-year structural warranty, and the finish is guaranteed for 5 years against fading, blistering, and peeling. Cushions and fabrics are also covered for 5 years, so you can relax knowing your chair is built to last. Personalizing your look is easy with 10 elegant frame finishes and over 100 fabric options. Whether it stands alone or completes a full seating group, the Classico High Back Swivel Rocker Lounge Chair offers exceptional comfort, graceful motion, and enduring craftsmanship.', 13, 43, NULL, NULL, '58.00', 'H 44.5" × W 28" × D 34"', FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, 26, TRUE, '2026-05-03T01:40:46.833Z'::timestamptz, '2026-06-23T18:22:37.259Z'::timestamptz, 0, '{"height_in":"44.5","collection":"Classico","weight_lbs":"58","arm_height_in":"26.75","seat_height_in":"17.75","spec_sheet_pdf":"https://www.owlee.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/Classico_Retail_SpecSheets_2026-upd_Part13.pdf","depth_length_in":"34","width_diameter_in":"28"}'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, 'fixed', NULL, '["o-w-lee","classico","made-in-usa"]'::jsonb, TRUE, NULL, NULL, 'Classico', 'classico', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Loung