(2050, 'Classico Love Seat', 'owlee-classico-love-seat-956-2sw', '956-2SW', NULL, 'The O.W. Lee Classico Love Seat offers intimate seating defined by elegant proportions and ornate detailing. Plush cushions and traditional styling make this outdoor love seat a refined addition to patios and courtyards. O.W. Lee is renowned for its exceptional quality, supported by an industry-leading warranty. Our frames are covered by a 20-year structural warranty, and the finish is guaranteed against fading, blistering, and peeling for 5 years. Cushions and fabrics are also backed by a 5-year warranty. With a selection of 10 elegant frame finishes and over 100 fabric options, customers can easily customize each piece to seamlessly complement their individual style.', 13, 43, NULL, NULL, '77.00', 'H 35.5" × W 53" × D 33.75"', FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, 27, TRUE, '2026-05-03T01:40:46.837Z'::timestamptz, '2026-06-23T18:22:37.259Z'::timestamptz, 0, '{"height_in":"35.5","collection":"Classico","weight_lbs":"77","arm_height_in":"26.5","seat_height_in":"18","spec_sheet_pdf":"https://www.owlee.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/Classico_Retail_SpecSheets_2026_956-2SW-Love-Seat.pdf","depth_length_in":"33.75","width_diameter_in":"53"}'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, 'fixed', NULL, '["o-w-lee","classico","made-in-usa"]'::jsonb, TRUE, NULL, NULL, 'Classico', 'classico', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Love Seats', NULL, NULL),
(2051, 'Classico Sofa', 'owlee-classico-sofa-956-3sw', '956-3SW', NULL, 'If you’re looking to anchor your outdoor space with something truly timeless, the O.W. Lee Classico Sofa makes a beautiful statement. Designed as a sophisticated focal point, this outdoor sofa features a classic silhouette, elegant decorative accents, and generous seating that invites everyone to gather. Its European-inspired design brings a sense of tradition and refinement to patios, terraces, and outdoor living rooms alike. Crafted with O.W. Lee’s renowned attention to quality, the Classico Sofa is built to stand up to the elements while maintaining its beauty. The wrought iron frame is backed by a 20-year structural warranty, and the finish is guaranteed for 5 years against fading, blistering, and peeling. Plush cushions and performance fabrics are also covered for 5 years, giving you confidence that your investment will look and feel great for years to come. Customization is simple and seamless. With 10 elegant frame finishes and over 100 fabric options, you can tailor the Classico Sofa to perfectly complement your outdoor décor. Whether you’re creating an intimate seating area or a grand outdoor gathering space, this sofa delivers classic style, lasting comfort, and craftsmanship you can trust.', 13, 43, NULL, NULL, '104.00', 'H 35.5" × W 76.25" × D 34"', FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, 28, TRUE, '2026-05-03T01:40:46.841Z'::timestamptz, '2026-06-23T18:22:37.259Z'::timestamptz, 0, '{"height_in":"35.5","collection":"Classico","weight_lbs":"104","arm_height_in":"26.5","seat_height_in":"18","spec_sheet_pdf":"https://www.owlee.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/Classico_Retail_SpecSheets_2026_956-3SW-Sofa.pdf","depth_length_in":"34","width_diameter_in":"76.25"}'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, 'fixed', NULL, '["o-w-lee","classico","made-in-usa"]'::jsonb, TRUE, NULL, NULL, 'Classico', 'classico', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Sofas', NULL, NULL),
