(2062, 'Classico 01 Side Table Base', 'owlee-classico-01-side-table-base-9-st01', '9-ST01', NULL, 'If you’re looking for an outdoor side table that’s as beautiful as it is dependable, the Classico Iron Side Table Base is a standout choice. Handcrafted from heavy-gauge wrought iron, it’s designed to provide rock-solid support while bringing a timeless, refined look to any outdoor space. One of the biggest advantages of the Classico base is its flexibility. It pairs effortlessly with a wide range of table top materials and sizes--whether you’re designing with sleek porcelain, ultra-durable Dekton®, or lightweight micro mesh. That means you can create exactly the table you want, without compromising on performance or style. Wrought iron is known for its strength and longevity, and you can feel the difference. The added weight keeps tables stable in windy conditions, while the material’s durability ensures the base holds up year after year outdoors. It’s furniture you can confidently invest in if you want something that truly lasts. With 10 finish options and numerous table top materials to choose from, the Classico Iron Table Base makes customization easy. It’s a smart investment for customers who value craftsmanship, versatility, and outdoor furniture built to stand the test of time. Fits Tops: - 24" Round (Porcelain, Dekton, or Mesh) - 24" Square (Porcelain or Dekton) - 30" Round (Porcelain or Mesh)', 13, 52, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'H 19.75" × W 16.25" × D 16.25"', FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, 39, TRUE, '2026-05-03T01:40:46.880Z'::timestamptz, '2026-06-23T18:22:37.259Z'::timestamptz, 0, '{"height_in":"19.75","collection":"Classico","weight_lbs":"22 (pkg)","arm_height_in":"—","seat_height_in":"—","spec_sheet_pdf":"https://www.owlee.com/collections/classico-iron-table-bases/classico-side-table-base/","depth_length_in":"16.25","width_diameter_in":"16.25"}'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, 'fixed', NULL, '["o-w-lee","classico","made-in-usa"]'::jsonb, TRUE, NULL, NULL, 'Classico', 'classico', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Table Bases', NULL, NULL),
