(2172, 'Table Bases Modern Aluminum 05 Bar Table Base', 'owlee-table-bases-modern-aluminum-05-bar-table-base-ma-bt05', 'MA-BT05', NULL, 'Sleek, minimal, and designed for contemporary outdoor living, our Modern Aluminum table bases provide a clean foundation for any table top. Crafted from durable, powder-coated aluminum, they are lightweight yet built to withstand the elements--resistant to rust, corrosion, and fading. Their streamlined design pairs effortlessly with porcelain, Dekton, or micro mesh tops and complements our Arc, Aris, Avana, and Studio collections, making them a versatile choice for both residential and commercial settings. Combining modern style with long-lasting performance, these bases are as practical as they are elegant. This base fits the following tops: - 28x50" (Porcelain, Micro Mesh) - 31x56" (Dekton) - 36x58" (porcelain, Micro Mesh)', 13, 52, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, 191, TRUE, '2026-05-03T01:40:47.435Z'::timestamptz, '2026-06-23T18:37:07.944Z'::timestamptz, 0, '{"collection":"Table Bases","weight_lbs":"29 (pkg)","spec_sheet_pdf":"https://www.owlee.com/collections/table-bases/modern-aluminum-05-bar-table-base/"}'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, 'fixed', NULL, '["o-w-lee","table-bases","made-in-usa"]'::jsonb, TRUE, NULL, NULL, 'Modern', 'table-bases', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Table Bases', NULL, NULL),
